    "body": "\n## Problem:\n*.Containerfile files (e.g. e2e-tests.Containerfile) are not detected as dockerfile, although *.Dockerfile is.\n\n## Solution:\nAdd Containerfile/containerfile to the extension table.\n",
    "closed_at": "2026-07-17T17:38:27Z",
